As a member of the Tuite Group, one of the city''s most experienced teams of real estate professionals, Betsy has the support and bandwidth to provide the highest level of service to her clients. Prior to embarking on a career in real estate, she served as the Director of Placement at both Suffolk Law School and Boston University School of Law.

Throughout her career, Betsy has represented buyers and sellers throughout the Greater Boston area. As a long term resident of various Boston neighborhoods, she has an intrinsic knowledge of local history and market trends throughout the city.

Betsy owns a 40-foot sailboat (The Scherherazade) which she races in Boston Harbor every Wednesday night in the inner harbor and on weekends in Marblehead from May to October. She is on the board of the Constitution Yacht Club which sponsors local races in Boston Harbor. She also serves on the board of the Friends of Meali International, which is a charitable organization which supports several primary schools in Tanzania.
